# RoamCast — Required sdkconfig settings for WiFi CSI feature
#
# If you enable ROAMCAST_FEATURE_CSI, your ESP32-S3 board must have
# WiFi CSI support enabled in the sdkconfig. For Arduino framework
# on ESP32-S3 (espressif32@6.7.0), CSI is already enabled by default.
#
# If you're building with ESP-IDF directly or a custom sdkconfig,
# ensure these options are set:

CONFIG_ESP32_WIFI_CSI_ENABLED=y

# For NimBLE (ROAMCAST_FEATURE_BLE), add these build_flags to your
# platformio.ini to minimize memory usage (observer-only scanning):
#
# build_flags =
#     -DCONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ROLE_CENTRAL_DISABLED
#     -DCONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ROLE_PERIPHERAL_DISABLED
#     -DCONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ROLE_BROADCASTER_DISABLED
